.TH MINITUN-SERVER 8 "2026-08-01" "MiniTun 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
minitun-server \- MiniTun public TCP tunnel server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B minitun-server
.B --tls-cert
.I file
.B --tls-key
.I file
.B --token-file
.I file
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B minitun-server
accepts authenticated TLS control and Worker connections and exposes
allowlisted public TCP tunnel ports. It stays in the foreground for
service-manager supervision.
.SH REQUIRED OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --tls-cert " file"
PEM certificate chain.
.TP
.BI --tls-key " file"
Matching PEM private key.
.TP
.BI --token-file " file"
Private authentication Token file. It must be a regular service-owned file
with no group or other permissions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --listen " endpoint"
TLS control listener. The default is 0.0.0.0:2333.
.TP
.BI --allow-ports " range"
Allowed public tunnel port or inclusive range. The packaged unit uses 6000-6999.
.TP
.BI --max-clients " count"
Maximum authenticated clients. The default is 1000.
.TP
.BI --max-tunnels-per-client " count"
Maximum tunnels registered by one client. The default is 128.
.TP
.BI --max-connections-per-client " count"
Maximum active public relays per client. The default is 10000.
.TP
.BI --max-total-connections " count"
Maximum active public relays across all clients. The default is 50000.
.TP
.BI --min-idle-workers " count"
Minimum idle Workers requested per session. The default is 2.
.TP
.BI --max-idle-workers " count"
Maximum idle Workers per session. The default is 32.
.TP
.BI --max-total-idle-workers " count"
Global idle Worker limit. The default is 128.
.TP
.BI --handshake-timeout " seconds"
TLS and authentication timeout. The default is 10 seconds.
.TP
.BI --heartbeat-interval " seconds"
Heartbeat interval. The default is 5 seconds.
.TP
.BI --heartbeat-timeout " seconds"
Heartbeat response timeout. The default is 15 seconds.
.TP
.BI --auth-clock-skew " seconds"
Maximum authentication clock skew. The default is 30 seconds.
.TP
.BI --worker-wait-timeout " seconds"
Maximum public-connection wait for an idle Worker. The default is 2 seconds.
.TP
.BI --worker-idle-timeout " seconds"
Idle Worker lifetime. The default is 60 seconds.
.TP
.BI --relay-idle-timeout " seconds"
Relay inactivity timeout. The default is 300 seconds.
.TP
.BI --shutdown-timeout " seconds"
Maximum graceful relay drain time. The default is 10 seconds.
.TP
.BI --io-threads " count"
Asio worker thread count, from 1 through 16.
.TP
.BI --log-level " level"
Structured log level: trace, debug, info, warn, error, critical, or off.
.TP
.B --foreground
Run in the foreground. This is the packaged service mode.
.TP
.B --version
Print version information and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/minitun-server/server.crt
Certificate chain used by the packaged unit.
.TP
.I /etc/minitun-server/server.key
Private key used by the packaged unit.
.TP
.I /etc/minitun-server/token
Authentication Token used by the packaged unit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR minitun (1),
.BR minitund (8),
.BR systemd.service (5)
